Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.08,0:00:06.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The world is awash in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.42,0:00:10.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, wars are fought between spies\Nover information -
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.46,0:00:11.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,in shadow wars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.29,0:00:32.50,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,We've got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.50,0:00:34.71,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,The target's eyes haven't adjusted\Nto the darkness yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.71,0:00:36.54,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Today is the day, Teach!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.54,0:00:38.33,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,We're finally going to make you admit defeat!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.13,0:00:48.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It all started five days ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.58,0:00:51.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Defeat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.63,0:00:53.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Make me say, "I surrender."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.08,0:00:56.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can use whatever methods you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.46,0:00:58.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Come up with plans as a group,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.08,0:01:00.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and take me down by the end of the month.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.92,0:01:02.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That concludes the lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.42,0:01:08.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, what was that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.08,0:01:09.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.50,0:01:11.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It will be a simulation of actual combat conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.63,0:01:12.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We could dig up dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.88,0:01:14.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Physically restrain him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.13,0:01:16.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Take his friends or loved ones hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.67,0:01:21.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In the world of espionage, spies are often asked\Nto manipulate and cajole their targets.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.08,0:01:23.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I suspect that's what this training is about.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.54,0:01:27.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He said we could use whatever\Nmethods we liked, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.42,0:01:29.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's what I heard too, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.79,0:01:32.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's all well and good, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.21,0:01:34.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was Klaus, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.67,0:01:36.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Feels like that guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.42,0:01:39.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...thinks we're a fuckin' joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.04,0:01:40.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Like he can walk all over us,\Njust 'cuz we're washouts!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.96,0:01:42.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Come on, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.33,0:01:44.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that's not what he-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.58,0:01:47.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, I say we teach him a lesson\Nand show him just how strong we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.58,0:01:48.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.13,0:01:52.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Seven against one will hardly make for decent training.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.67,0:01:54.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We can just win by sheer numbers!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.21,0:01:56.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's all go attack him together!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.04,0:02:03.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are there any more complaints about my lesson plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.63,0:02:04.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.83,0:02:06.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.04,0:02:08.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Next time, make sure to actually use your heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.92,0:02:19.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That marked the start of our radical new\NDefeat Teach curriculum, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.79,0:02:34.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For the next five days,\Nall we did was rack up one loss after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.67,0:03:02.88,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,We've got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.88,0:03:05.17,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,The target's eyes haven't adjusted\Nto the darkness yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.17,0:03:06.96,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Today is the day, Teach!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.96,0:03:08.75,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,We're finally going to make you admit defeat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.25,0:03:10.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hope you're-
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.75,0:03:11.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hope you're read-
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.42,0:03:14.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Damn it, Lily!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.92,0:03:16.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey! Keep your hands to yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.29,0:03:17.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I ain't touchin' shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.88,0:03:21.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's not my fault your tits are so damn big.\N{\rSubtitle-3}S-settle down. The target has no clothes, let alone a weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.63,0:03:25.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.63,0:03:29.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By my count, that makes thirteen attempts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.92,0:03:32.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I applaud your tenacity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.50,0:03:35.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That said, your plans still need work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.75,0:03:40.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When you attack someone, you need to be\Nas sharp as a wind racing through a valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.29,0:03:41.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,At least put on a towel!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.96,0:03:43.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's no need.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.54,0:03:47.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A first-rate spy thinks nothing of\Nbeing seen in the nude.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.13,0:03:48.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm heading out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.67,0:03:50.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll return tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.00,0:03:52.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When I do, I expect you to launch another attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.71,0:04:00.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was right there in front of my face!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.54,0:04:02.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's toying with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.88,0:04:06.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Shit, and with that smug-ass look on his face, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.33,0:04:09.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,At this rate, the month's gonna end before we know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.46,0:04:12.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And when it does, we're gonna go\Non that Impossible Mission...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.21,0:04:13.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...and get slaughtered.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.63,0:04:15.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Each and every one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.21,0:04:16.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Monika...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.42,0:04:19.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,At the same time,\Nit's too late to go back to our academies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.67,0:04:21.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're boxed in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.04,0:04:22.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That Klaus punk...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.46,0:04:26.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,With skills like his, I bet he's never even\Nbeen in a bind like ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.33,0:04:27.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.83,0:04:31.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He probably can't empathize with\Nthe worries of washouts like us at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.71,0:04:32.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.58,0:04:35.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.58,0:04:43.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He might not show it, but I think Teach has\Nburdens of his own he's carrying.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.63,0:04:44.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lily?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.58,0:04:49.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We'll resume our lesson when he gets back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.00,0:04:53.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Before that, though,\NI have a suggestion to make as your leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.96,0:04:55.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Leader, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.75,0:04:58.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For the record, I don't remember\Never signing off on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.50,0:04:59.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,C'mon, don't be like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.88,0:05:01.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here, have a financier with your tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.96,0:05:04.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What is that supposed to be, a bribe?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.00,0:05:05.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll have one, Leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.67,0:05:07.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Leader, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.21,0:05:08.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sellouts, the lot of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.50,0:05:11.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Would you like some more tea, Monika?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.79,0:05:23.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's new information regarding\Nyour Impossible Mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.08,0:05:27.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.67,0:05:30.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How are the girls holding up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.38,0:05:33.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I understand you've been having\Na hard time teaching them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.17,0:05:36.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nothing gets past you, does it, C?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.58,0:05:40.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess you're not in charge of the Cabinet Office's\NForeign Intelligence Office for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.79,0:05:44.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're a good spy, Klaus,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.08,0:05:46.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but your stubbornness causes headaches\Nfor the people around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.25,0:05:50.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You need to make sure you're doing\Neverything you can to assuage the girls' fears.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.79,0:05:52.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't need you to tell me that-
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.17,0:05:53.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, I think I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.21,0:05:58.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I used to be able to count on your team\Nto get through to you, but they're gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.71,0:06:09.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How about this, Idiot Pupil?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.54,0:06:12.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you make it back alive, I've got a new title for you:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.71,0:06:15.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The Greatest Spy in the World.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.17,0:06:17.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'd say you will have earned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.96,0:06:20.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's got a nice ring to it, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.13,0:06:24.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.63,0:06:26.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You don't want to flee?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.96,0:06:28.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not in the slightest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.08,0:06:34.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You took me in when I was an orphan\Nand raised me to be a spy,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.25,0:06:37.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and I can never thank the boss enough for hiring me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.71,0:06:41.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It would be no exaggeration for me to say\Nthat I love each and every person on this team.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.67,0:06:48.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm no expert on families,\Nbut that's what I think of you all as.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.50,0:06:53.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And nothing brings me more satisfaction than\Nrisking my life on behalf of my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.17,0:06:56.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When the hell'd you get so eloquent, Bonfire?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.50,0:07:10.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.88,0:07:15.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Everyone's here, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.21,0:07:17.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.21,0:07:21.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's something I want to talk to you all\Nabout regarding the mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.83,0:07:25.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,First of all, Lamplight isn't the first team\Nto attempt this Impossible Mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.67,0:07:28.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There was another one that went before us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.13,0:07:31.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That team was called Inferno.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.50,0:07:33.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I know that name.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.71,0:07:37.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're the best spy team in the Din Republic, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.79,0:07:41.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're what every team in the nation aspires to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.79,0:07:45.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I heard that during the Great War,\Nthey stole intel on the Imperial army
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.00,0:07:47.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and saved the lives of hundreds\Nof thousands of civilians.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.38,0:07:51.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wanting to join Inferno was the\Nreason I became a spy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.96,0:07:54.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, Inferno is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.04,0:07:56.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It no longer exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.29,0:07:58.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.63,0:08:01.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Because only one person on the team survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.29,0:08:03.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And he's standing in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.33,0:08:11.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,One year ago, I, code name Bonfire,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.46,0:08:16.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,split off from the group and went on a solo op\Nper my mentor Guido's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.04,0:08:21.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,While I was gone, the rest of Inferno's members\Ntook on an Impossible Mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.54,0:08:24.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,None of them made it back alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.67,0:08:29.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Inferno was like family to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.88,0:08:34.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wanted us to change this world,\Nawash in pain, together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.92,0:08:36.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But now, that can never happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.33,0:08:39.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious.\NThey all got wiped out?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.67,0:08:42.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're saying they were\Nthe best spy team in the nation...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.54,0:08:46.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...and they died on the very same mission\Nwe'll be attempting in a month?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.25,0:08:49.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I apologize for frightening you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.96,0:08:53.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As your instructor,\NI make no excuses for my ineptitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.04,0:08:58.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That said, I had a very good reason\Nfor choosing the seven of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.96,0:09:00.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want you to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.63,0:09:02.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,However, I'm not going to force you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.63,0:09:04.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's up to each of you to decide
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.25,0:09:07.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,if you're coming on the Impossible Mission or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.96,0:09:09.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Teach...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.42,0:09:11.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you wish to flee, that right is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.33,0:09:14.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For me, this mission is one of personal revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.08,0:09:18.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's an important mission,\Nand the fate of our nation hangs in the balance,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.38,0:09:21.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but that isn't reason enough for the\Nseven of you to risk your lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.58,0:09:25.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.42,0:09:29.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You all...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.42,0:09:32.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Still, to think that you were\Nactually a member of Inferno.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.50,0:09:38.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We had our suspicions,\Nbut it hits different actually hearing you say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.13,0:09:39.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You did?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.33,0:09:40.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.54,0:09:43.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Y'see, Lily had this idea, so we spent the afternoon...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.33,0:09:48.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...investigating Heat Haze Palace's old residents.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.17,0:09:56.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We found traces from a couple people\Nof all sorts of ages and genders.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.58,0:09:59.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then, after subtly asking around\Nat Garmouth Seminary,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.54,0:10:03.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,we obtained some testimonies that\Nsupported our hypothesis.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.38,0:10:11.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We figured that the people who lived here\Nmust have been really important to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.63,0:10:16.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You probably hit rock bottom\Nwhen you lost the people you cared about.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.25,0:10:20.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, we were at rock bottom too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.08,0:10:25.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're not about to abandon a fellow bottom-dweller!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.92,0:10:27.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're in the same hole here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.58,0:10:30.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's climb out of it together!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.42,0:10:31.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.63,0:10:32.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If I may, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.83,0:10:34.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We all feel the same way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.29,0:10:38.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're gonna train us up real good before the mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.71,0:10:40.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Right, Bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.50,0:10:44.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.83,0:10:49.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.42,0:10:50.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're all in?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.42,0:10:52.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I mean, hey, if the team leader says so.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.54,0:10:54.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ooh! You finally signed off on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.83,0:10:56.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She was being sarcastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.04,0:10:58.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait, that's so mean, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.38,0:11:00.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's okay, Leader, settle down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.46,0:11:01.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.79,0:11:05.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A good leader can't let an eensy bit\Nof sarcasm get to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.29,0:11:13.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can see I made the right choice picking you\Nas Lamplight's leader, Flower Garden Lily.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.46,0:11:15.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, obviously!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.58,0:11:16.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In twenty days,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.79,0:11:20.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,we'll be heading to the Galgad Empire\Nto begin the Impossible Mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.63,0:11:24.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Until then, I'll continue forging\Nyou all into proper spies.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.79,0:11:29.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're going to complete this mission,\Nand we're all going to make it back alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.42,0:11:31.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.04,0:11:42.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When the time came,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.71,0:11:46.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Teach and the rest of us headed to where the\NImpossible Mission was going to take place:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.88,0:11:49.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,the Galgad Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.92,0:12:08.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's go time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.13,0:12:12.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're going to split up and infiltrate Galgad\Nas two separate groups.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.25,0:12:16.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're coming all the way to the Empire\Nto watch some plays?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.96,0:12:18.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sounds like someone's living high on the hog.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.50,0:12:19.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who, little old me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.92,0:12:21.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The others are in the dining car right now, but-
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.46,0:12:22.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Pardon me...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.04,0:12:24.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah, they're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.25,0:12:30.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As team leader, Lily, you're going to be\Nspearheading one of the groups,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.29,0:12:32.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,while I lead up the other one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.21,0:12:34.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, you're a wood engraver?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.04,0:12:35.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Indeed, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.96,0:12:37.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.92,0:12:39.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My apprentices do me proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.67,0:13:01.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,From here on out, we'll be operating separately.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.79,0:13:03.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Any last things you want to say to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.83,0:13:06.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll save them for the next time we see each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.88,0:13:08.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Until we're done here,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.75,0:13:11.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm going to avoid making contact with\Nanyone besides the Intel squad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.00,0:13:22.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We should head out, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.08,0:13:35.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Our job is to steal a sample from a lab\Non the Imperial capital's outskirts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.54,0:13:38.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yup, that's an Impossible Mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.25,0:13:42.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The Endy Laboratory, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.00,0:13:45.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Officially, the lab belongs to a\Npharmaceutical company,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.33,0:13:46.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but in truth...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.50,0:13:51.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...the Imperial army secretly uses it to conduct\Ncutting-edge weapons research.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.83,0:13:52.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.83,0:13:54.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Naturally, security there is tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.25,0:13:59.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Everything is going to hinge on how much\Nintel we can gather ahead of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.29,0:14:08.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The two of us on the Intel squad will start\Nby gathering information.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.21,0:14:17.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And over on the Specialist squad,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.13,0:14:19.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,we'll use our special talents\Nto support the other squads, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.83,0:14:23.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you, Mr. Bernard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.38,0:14:40.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It says the Intel squad's used their\Ndata to identify a key player,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.42,0:14:43.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and they want the Operations squad,\Nwhich is to say "us," to make contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.33,0:14:46.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Cool, then I'm gonna go do my own thing solo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.04,0:14:47.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wh-
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.71,0:14:49.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It'll be more efficient.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.63,0:14:51.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This way, I'll be able to help the entire team out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.79,0:14:59.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I swear, she thinks she's better than us\Njust 'cuz she's better than us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.04,0:15:01.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What about Klaus?\NCan we get him to help us out?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.25,0:15:04.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"I'm devoting all my efforts\Nto providing backup," he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.92,0:15:07.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He also said...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.96,0:15:12.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As far as specifics go, Intel should make\Nlike a rose proudly blooming.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.50,0:15:15.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Operations should zoop-zoop-zoop around,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.83,0:15:18.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and the Specialist squad should watch over you\Nas they would a baby bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.63,0:15:20.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want everyone giving it their all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.50,0:15:23.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeesh, this is like some sorta sick joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.00,0:15:24.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.08,0:15:28.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We trained our butts off for this, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.08,0:15:30.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We've got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.29,0:15:32.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We won't let anyone call us washouts again!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.83,0:15:42.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Heh, easy peasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.00,0:15:44.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.21,0:15:46.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A dummy.\NThis one here's the real one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.13,0:15:49.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Klaus pulled the same trick on me once.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.13,0:15:51.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Looks like our training is paying off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.67,0:15:53.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That guy was a drug dealer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.42,0:15:57.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We should find some of the lab's staff\Non the client list in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.04,0:15:58.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hold it there, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.83,0:16:03.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're tourists, I take it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.71,0:16:06.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but this is a prime area for pickpockets.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.75,0:16:09.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm going to have to check your bags, just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.75,0:16:11.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But we, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.08,0:16:18.29,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.29,0:16:21.21,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I could put them to sleep and we could escape,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.21,0:16:23.96,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,but then the cops would start looking for us...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.96,0:16:25.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.75,0:16:26.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.58,0:16:29.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for cooperating.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.33,0:16:30.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I hope you two enjoy your trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.17,0:16:35.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sybilla, where'd you hide the-
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.08,0:16:36.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.46,0:16:38.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Someone stole my stolen wallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.88,0:16:41.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's only one dude I know who\Ncould pull off a stunt like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.75,0:16:52.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What a stand-up guy.\NA magnificent one, even.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.83,0:16:54.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.46,0:16:57.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Still, I was scared stiff back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.42,0:17:00.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sooner or later, our luck's gonna run out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.83,0:17:07.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As things stand, I worry that some of us\Nwon't last until the main operation...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.42,0:17:25.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is that from Klaus?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.67,0:17:27.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, it's from Lily.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.54,0:17:38.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have the wine you ordered, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.71,0:17:39.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.42,0:17:47.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That is an excellent disguise,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.17,0:17:49.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I don't see why you felt the need\Nto remove your mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.50,0:17:52.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't like to cross-dress around you, Boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.67,0:17:55.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, suit yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.25,0:18:00.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What is all that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.71,0:18:03.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,High-level Imperial classified information.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.63,0:18:05.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You collected that all on your own?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.04,0:18:12.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed at how much intel\Nyou girls have collected, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.42,0:18:13.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And in such a short time, no less.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.13,0:18:18.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see we have confirmation that the sample\Nhasn't been moved from the Endy Laboratory.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.54,0:18:20.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have another piece of news for you as well, Boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.92,0:18:27.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Our leader, Lily, was asking about us possibly holding\Na party the night before the operation...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.13,0:18:29.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.33,0:18:31.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My ears must be failing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.00,0:18:32.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did you say "a party"?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.75,0:18:37.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,According to her message, she wants us all\Nto gather and share a meal together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.08,0:18:39.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Has she forgotten that we're spies in hostile territory?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.92,0:18:43.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That girl's shamelessness knows no bounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.00,0:18:47.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I believe she's worried about the team's fatigue levels.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.04,0:18:49.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And I share her concerns.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.38,0:18:51.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.13,0:18:55.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For the rest of you, this is your first real mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.58,0:18:57.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The exhaustion is starting to get to you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.25,0:19:00.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll make a reservation at a\Ntrustworthy restaurant, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.71,0:19:02.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and have your party.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.54,0:19:03.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just make sure you don't get tailed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.92,0:19:04.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If I may!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.92,0:19:07.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If it's only us, then there's a faint possibility\Nthat something could go wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.67,0:19:08.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then call off the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.25,0:19:12.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But if you joined us, that problem would be resolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.83,0:19:14.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We wouldn't be in any danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.33,0:19:17.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.96,0:19:20.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks for convincing him, Grete!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.83,0:19:24.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sup!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.46,0:19:25.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, you made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.83,0:19:28.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What are you three doing,\Ngetting started all on your own?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.00,0:19:29.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.50,0:19:31.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Klaus'll be here soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.42,0:19:44.33,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I did some recon on the restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.33,0:19:46.67,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,If I keep watch from up here, everything will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.54,0:19:52.63,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Still, I'm not nearly as invincible as they think I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.17,0:19:54.38,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,After all,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.92,0:19:58.75,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,against him, I've never once...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.38,0:20:08.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.75,0:20:16.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you not understand the situation we're in?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.29,0:20:18.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How are you not more stressed?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.42,0:20:19.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Stressed?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.88,0:20:22.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're stressed as hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.29,0:20:23.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.38,0:20:25.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I mean, of course we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.92,0:20:28.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How could we not be scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.08,0:20:33.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We've been shakin' in our boots\Nsince the minute we left Din.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.63,0:20:35.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then, how?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.46,0:20:40.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Cuz you said you'd come today, that's how.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.92,0:20:42.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're late, FYI.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.00,0:20:45.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's why we figured we'd be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.50,0:20:48.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your strength is the one thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.92,0:20:52.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,we believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.38,0:20:55.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,At least pretend to be on guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.29,0:20:58.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is important, Klaus.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.29,0:21:01.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When someone lets you watch them sleep,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.71,0:21:03.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,it's a sign of how much they trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.92,0:21:07.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, if anyone lets you see them like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.63,0:21:09.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,make sure you do whatever it takes to protect them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.17,0:21:14.33,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Why is it that looking at them
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.33,0:21:16.63,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,reminds me so much of Inferno?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.50,0:21:18.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Whatever the reason, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.83,0:21:20.63,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I feel like my resolve is firmer now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.00,0:21:26.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait, when did he bail on us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.21,0:21:27.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.29,0:21:31.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's from Teach.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.67,0:21:33.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Change of plans."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.33,0:21:35.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"We talked about you going in from the east
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.00,0:21:38.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and me from the west, but we're reversing that."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.25,0:21:43.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Furthermore, I know it couldn't have been easy
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.08,0:21:45.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,having with a boss who couldn't teach or explain things."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.75,0:21:46.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"You have my thanks."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.00,0:21:49.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.00,0:21:51.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We never managed to make him say "I surrender"...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.46,0:21:53.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...but at least we got him to say "thank you".
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.42,0:21:56.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That airhead actually thanked us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.96,0:21:58.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He could have easily been doing it on a whim.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.96,0:22:03.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.21,0:22:10.25,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Thinking back now, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.92,0:22:15.79,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,that might have been the moment that us\NLamplight girls and Teach truly became a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.08,0:22:20.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There it is, the Endy Laboratory.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.88,0:22:26.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's where they're hiding the sample that\Nwe need to steal back for our mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.75,0:22:33.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As you're aware, Klaus,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.17,0:22:38.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,there is a postwar international treaty\Nbanning the use of biological weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.88,0:22:42.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,However, it doesn't ban their development.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.79,0:22:49.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Or at least, that's how the imbeciles\Nin our army chose to interpret it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.38,0:22:53.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After they went ahead and continued their research,\Na Galgad spy stole one of their samples.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.75,0:22:57.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,According to our lab boys, it should take Galgad\Na year to analyze the compound.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.79,0:23:02.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,However, we've received word from one of our\Ncollaborators in their capital, Darton,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.71,0:23:05.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,that the Imperial research efforts are\Nproceeding faster than anticipated.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.54,0:23:06.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,At this rate...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.54,0:23:09.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...the casualty count could well reach into the millions.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.79,0:23:15.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The Empire has no qualms about getting\Ninnocent civilians caught up in their assassinations.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.75,0:23:19.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I need you and the girls to retrieve that bioweapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.88,0:23:22.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's a killer virus, and its name...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.13,0:23:28.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...is Abyss Doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.58,0:00:44.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(512,165.6)}{\an7}SPY CLASSROOM
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.13,0:00:49.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(780.8,561.6)}{\an7}MISSION: Flower Garden II
